      "ArticleTitle": "Effects of morphine on: spontaneous, dorsal raphe, spinal tract of trigeminal nucleus, medial lemniscus and reticular lateral magnocellular evoked responses of hypothalamic units, in naive and morphine physically dependent rats.",
